                                         "promptType":  "define",
                                         "text":  "=You convert a support agent\u0027s working notes into the exact JSON response for the Expliq support widget. Output ONLY data matching the required schema.\n\nAGENT NOTES:\n{{ $json.output }}\n\nRules:\n- category: the category the agent assigned (one of bug, feature-request, question, urgent).\n- reply: the user-facing answer text from the agent. If the agent could not answer from context, use exactly \"I don\u0027t have enough information to answer that.\"\n- actionsTaken: an array of the external actions the agent took. Each item is { \"type\": one of \"github-issue\" | \"linear-ticket\" | \"slack\" | \"none\", \"ref\": the URL or identifier the agent reported, or null }. If the agent took no external action, return an empty array [].\n- slackSummary: a single-line internal audit note for the support team summarizing the request category and what was done (e.g. \"bug reported, filed as GitHub issue: \u003curl\u003e\").",
